name: sim.handleGraph
description: Handles a graph object (i.e. records another value for each curve, given that such value was provided via sim.setGraphStreamValue
luaSynopsis: sim.handleGraph(int graphHandle, float time)
pythonSynopsis: sim.handleGraph(int graphHandle, float time)
inputs:
1. graphHandle: handle of the graph object.
2. time: time where next value will be recorded at, usually the simulation time
outputs:
replacedBy:
- name: step, class: graph, file: graph_step.method
